{"author":{"id":"836d943203cf5a4f01ab5d4b4780de84949c43734f2256a167cc5931ae5d8c66"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1794234644,"nonce":"LPSfhyNjwS1YdbrTcZoLvJqL0xg=","title":"gbtracker: compact navigation and de-duplicated chrome","message":"## Goal\nEvery action has one home: a compact, centered sidebar, a lean top bar, no plugin-specific \"roadmap\" wording, and no stub pages.\n\n## Context\n- `src/ui/screen.rs:79` `top_bar` duplicates sidebar nav (Repositories pill), the Issues repo picker (repo popover), the Repositories page actions (overflow menu) and the theme button (identity popover).\n- `src/ui/screen.rs:253` `sidebar` has loose spacing, off-center rail icons and a faded header that leaves an empty block when collapsed.\n- `src/ui/screen.rs:321` `content` renders four placeholder pages with `Message::Noop` buttons.\n\n## Layers (merge bottom-up)\n1. \u003ckey TBD\u003e — L1 — Drop roadmap wording: Check Done, Active work\n2. \u003ckey TBD\u003e — L2 — Lean top bar: remove avatar, identity, repo and overflow popovers\n3. \u003ckey TBD\u003e — L3 — Compact sidebar: four sections, centered rail icons, no empty header\n4. \u003ckey TBD\u003e — L4 — Repositories page: one-line repo rows\n\n## Out of scope\n- Building Labels, Identities, Bridges or Analytics pages.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- Every child Task merged\n- No user-visible string contains \"roadmap\"; each top-bar action exists in exactly one place","files":null}]}